# This project has no build step, so Vercel's static preset ships every file
# in the repo as a public asset unless excluded here. supabase/ is backend-only
# tooling (schema.sql, RLS policy source, edge function source) that the CLI
# needs locally but the browser never should — without this file it was
# reachable at https://<your-domain>/supabase/schema.sql.
supabase
